      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>O Pokémon Néctar de Maçã. Appletun se alimenta principalmente de maçãs doces, mas também come pequenos Pokémon inseto atraídos por seu néctar. Quando Lechonk tenta lamber suas costas, ele lança uma substância pegajosa para afastá-lo.</p><p><strong>SR:</strong> 8 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Nível Mínimo Encontrado:</strong> 5 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Grupo de Ovos:</strong> Dragão, Grama &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Gênero:</strong> 50% M / 50% F &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Estágio Evolutivo:</strong> 3/5</p><p><strong>Evolução:</strong> Appletun é a evolução final de Applin.</p><h3>Moves por Nível</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Nível</th><th>Moves adquiridos</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style='text-align:center'>2</td><td>Astonish, Growth, Headbutt, Recycle, Sweet Scent, Withdraw Curse</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>3</td><td>Stomp</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>4</td><td>Leech Seed</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>6</td><td>Protect</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>7</td><td>Bullet Seed</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>8</td><td>Recover</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>10</td><td>Apple Acid</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>11</td><td>Body Slam</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>12</td><td>Iron Defense</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>14</td><td>Dragon Pulse</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>15</td><td>Energy Ball</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>TMs</h3><p>Amnesia, Attract, Body Press, Body Slam, Bulldoze, Bullet Seed, Curse, Draco Meteor, Dragon Pulse, Dragon Tail, Earthquake, Endure, Energy Ball, Facade, Giga Drain, Giga Impact, Grass Knot, Grassy Glide, Grassy Terrain, Gyro Ball, Heavy Slam, Helping Hand, High Horsepower, Hyper Beam, Iron Defense, Iron Head, Leaf Storm, Light Screen, Magical Leaf, Outrage, Payback, Pounce, Protect, Rain Dance, Reflect, Rest, Round, Safeguard, Seed Bomb, Sleep Talk, Snore, Solar Beam, Stomping Tantrum, Substitute, Sunny Day, Take Down, Te